{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026年Vogue時尚之力盛會《Forces of Fashion》今晚（23日）在蘇州舉行，紅氈盛會中，不少女星做性感擔當，包括內地女星孫千、孟子義和陳都靈都騷出性感低線，孫千以黑色西裝套裝中性示人，內裏配搭黑色透視內衣外穿，極為惹火；</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.213481+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.991633+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.991633+00:00","content_hash":"7258d7e85daf4c55c8a268181ea5987a7a5b6c8e4d6d5df3c945ff1268ac7840","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}